              "text": "易希道教授紀念奬助學金申請表 Professor Yi Hsi-Dao Memorial Scholarship Application Form 申請日期 Application Date： 年 Year 月 Month 日 Day 生命科學院 College of Life Sciences 學號 Student ID： 系(所) Department (Institute): 年級 Grade： 姓名 Name： 手機 Mobile Phone： 申請資格及檢附證明文件(請申請者先行確認並勾選)： Eligibility and Required Documents (Please confirm and check the relevant boxes) □本國籍生命科學院在學學生(不含在職專班學生)。 Student currently enrolled in the College of Life Sciences (excluding in-service programs). □中低收入戶證明或清寒證明。 Proof of low or middle-income status. □前一學期成績單總平均七十五分以上(含班上排名)。 Transc ript with an average score of 75 or above for the previous semester (including class ranking). 114學年度 第1學期 114th Academic Year, 1st Semester 成績 Grades 操行 Conduct Grade 班上成績排名 Class Ranking 班排名／班上人數 Class Rank /Total Students % 已明瞭本校最新版本個資隱私權政策聲明與個人資料當事人權利聲明，同意本校使用其 申請相關資料於獎助學金相關業務，且概不退件。若其他獎學金有規定不得兼領其他獎 助學金，同意領取先通知或先核定得獎之獎學金，放棄選擇權與不兼領獎學金。 I acknowledge that I have re ad and understood the latest ve rsion of the university's personal data privacy policy and the rights of the data subject. I consent to the university using my application- related information for scholarship- related purposes and understand that my applicati on will not be returned. If other scholarships prohibit simultaneous receipt of multiple awards, I agree to accept the first awarded scholarship and forfeit my right to select or receive other scholarships. 簽名 Signature：_______________________ 備註 Notes 一、收件期間：115 年5 月 18 日至 5月22 日17 時止。 Submission period: 05/18~05/22 17:00. 二、學生查詢學雜費減免及獎助學金方式：至「興大入口-學務資訊系 統-助學資訊-學生獎助資料」查詢。 To check on tuition and fee reductions and scholarships: Visit \"National Chung Hsing University Portal - Student Affairs Information System - Financial Aid Information - Student Scholarship Data.\""
