              "text": "National Chung Hsing University “Lagoon Co., Ltd. Scholarship for Disadvantaged Students” Application Form 1.Applicant Information： 2.Family Status (Including Parents, Spouse, Children, Siblings)： Relationship Name Age Living Deceased Health Condition Employer or School Attending Remarks /Job Title： /Job Title： /Job Title： /Job Title： /Job Title： 3.Reason for Applying for the Scholarship (Please provide detailed information about family hardships, financial situation, and how these factors affect your ability to pursue your studies for review purposes) ： Photo Attachment Area Name Student ID Department of Study College Department Grade E - Mmail Contact Number Previous Academic Year Grades First Semester Academic Score Second Semester Academic Score Average Score First Semester Class Rank % First Semester Conduct Score Second Semester Conduct Score Average Score Second Semester Class Rank % Address □Major Family Changes in the Past Year Description： (If the space provided is insufficient, please attach additional pages.) 4.Career Plan (Including Plans for Using the Scholarship)： 5. Recommendation (To be completed by the advisor or supervising professor) Recommender’s Signature/Seal: Contact Number： 6. Supporting Documents: Please double-check to ensure all required documents have been attached. Require d Docume nts □Application Form、□Transcript with Class Ranking for the Previous Academic Year (Not required for new students)、□Copy of the New-Style Household Registration Booklet or Household Registration Transcript Note: Applicants must have already obtained the tuition and miscellaneous fee waiver qualification from the university at the time of application. Others □Proof of Major Family Changes、 □Others (please specify): 7. If any of the information I have provided is found to be false, I agree to forfeit eligibility for the scholarship in accordance with relevant regulations. I also solemnly acknowledge that this scholarship is sponsored by generous benefactors, and I commit to diligent study and to giving back to society upon completion of my education. 8. (1) I agree to provide my personal information to the scholarship review committee for application, collection, processing, and utilization. (2) I am willing to comply with all procedures related to receiving the scholarship. Failure to participate without a valid reason will be considered as a waiver of the scholarship. Hereby respectfully submitted to National Chung Hsing University Applicant’s Signature/Seal： Date： Year Month Day"
